{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_004yuk_title", "source_sha256": "b1c5f6e79c06e85ed7553a77232fbdc114b808e00b25c5fad17b62fd05597e9b", "ja": "雪歩と舞台裏", "zh": "雪步与后台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_004yuk_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4d6d0ac2c72b2c0620b7f435a2d909490cdf897a6173aefe7a72304c1ada937c", "ja": "雪歩との舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "这是与雪步在舞台幕后的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_004yuk_1000_004yuk", "source_sha256": "94553d83b7734d9fbdbd8a7bafcd3067bd48e1719691a09f964b2bb3f8a0e39e", "ja": "すう、はあ……。\nうん、落ち着いて、気をしっかり持てば大丈夫……。", "zh": "吸气，呼气……  \n嗯，只要冷静下来，打起精神就没事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_004yuk_1001_402cpr", "source_sha256": "4ca209dc6b5be6281fea366e4b1cb48d109be950ca4d129ac525fc37adb33a37", "ja": "雪歩、控室の前で何してるんだ？\n中に入らないのか？", "zh": "雪步，你在休息室门口做什么呢？不进去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_004yuk_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "85ef77822854feaa37ee00d85e8a3192e9c0166d16223a405f39d34e9a70e2a9", "ja": "プロデューサー……あの、中に新しいプロデューサーが\nいるので、いちおう深呼吸を……。ごめんなさい。", "zh": "制作人……那个，里面有新的制作人，所以我先深呼吸一下……对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_004yuk_1003_402cpr", "source_sha256": "613a272482e914cd273de7fcc3f321d6d9f6616eaca4670ceeb1215fa702dd94", "ja": "あ、そっか……。アイツも雪歩にとってはまだ、\n『見慣れない男の人』か。", "zh": "啊，原来如此……对雪步来说，那家伙也还只是个“看着眼生的男人”啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_004yuk_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b2c1d99e75309761b676a529d42ea89a4ed084233a3fd39c68e62604293f27a0", "ja": "は、はい……でも大丈夫です、絶対平気になりますっ。\nもう少しお話しできたら、きっと……。", "zh": "是、是的……不过没关系，我绝对会习惯的。\n要是能再聊一会儿的话，一定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_004yuk_1005_402cpr", "source_sha256": "1dec022e719f4e81f00e6d101bb0cdc61e0b6a146b7a6bf2ddf86cdec1d25689", "ja": "無理しなくていいんだぞ？\nゆっくり慣れていけば、そのうち……。", "zh": "不用勉强自己哦？慢慢适应就好，过一阵子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_004yuk_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "493ebdc447da2c244edb637e4188ec5d62def3152ff8aa6659ea49a8ed4050eb", "ja": "ダメです。先輩がダメダメなままだと、せっかく新しく\n入ってくれた子たちがガッカリしちゃうから……。", "zh": "不行。要是前辈一直这么差劲，好不容易加入进来的孩子们会失望的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_004yuk_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2aacdb3c00ebe25ab4181b7ee1caabab0fa3428de24ea2ce6e180b4fbc174604", "ja": "それに、その子たちのプロデューサーになる人なら……\n男の人っていうか、もう……仲間の人です。", "zh": "而且，要成为那些孩子的制作人……与其说是男人，不如说……是伙伴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_004yuk_1008_402cpr", "source_sha256": "3bb955e9c5a87406b4ba80764d95fb25b7d5627a5b4aade68c7ff0633bc7511e", "ja": "……そうだな。よし、じゃあ俺と一緒に中に入って、\n楽しく会話してみるか！", "zh": "……说得也是。好，那就和我一起进去，开心地聊聊天吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_004yuk_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "abdc1d3c836dd2f076717c5bc219e743bc659e8c748a49cc9cc053d59bdbcdb3", "ja": "は、はいぃ！　あ、ちょっと練習しますね。\nええと……。", "zh": "好、好的！我、我先稍微练习一下。\n那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_004yuk_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ab4d7907866054ac78ae752057ac61e97664f4527f05f734ac28e3f4e17926ee", "ja": "こ、こんにちは～。ほ、本日は、お日柄もよくて、\nええと……い、イベント日和ですね！", "zh": "那、那个，你好～。今、今天天气真好，\n呃……很适合办活动呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_004yuk_1011_402cpr", "source_sha256": "c639269e49ce4eb71b99742b8026633262aa02709a79f1f4567a7204f68be427", "ja": "……。無理しなくていいんだぞ？", "zh": "……不用勉强自己哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
